  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The idea is that this toggle can be used for physics bone components that might not be appropriate for all other users, especially minors and strangers, to be groping and interacting with (i.e. the breast), and still allow for other components like tails and ears to be played with. It should enable interaction only for your own self, and it should come with a manual permissions system in the client where you can enable interactions for different trust ranks (i.e. Trusted or Friend) as well as manually grant people the ability to interact with these components. This will greatly reduce the random unwanted groping from users ingame, as well as discourage random users from interacting with these components on random people’s avatars. Ideally, this should ship with some sort of auto-detection system of chains that are attached at the chest and other similar chains for older and converted avatars",
